						&lt;p style="margin-top:2.65pt; margin-left:9pt; margin-bottom:1.5pt; text-indent:-9pt; line-height:120%; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;FirstEnergy Pennsylvania Electric Company, a Pennsylvania electric utility subsidiary of FirstEnergy Pennsylvania Holding Company LLC, a wholly owned subsidiary of FE&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
