							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;Stipulation and Recommendation, dated November 1, 2021, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;entered into&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt; by and among the Ohio Companies, the OCC, PUCO Staff, and several other signatories&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
